t:  <none>\n    Mounts:\nVolumes:\n  input:\n    Type:        ConfigMap (a volume populated by a ConfigMap)\n    Name:        workload-input\n    Optional:    false\nEvents:\n  Warning  FailedMount  19m (x23 over 49m)    kubelet            MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap references non-existent config key: unavailable-key\n  Warning  FailedMount  4m28s (x20 over 47m)  kubelet            Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input], unattached volumes=[input]: timed out waiting for the condition\n关键状态/事件:", "raw_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/dc0c18d69a344258-g1/tools/004-evidence-kubectl_describe.raw.txt", "structured_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/dc0c18d69a344258-g1/tools/004-evidence-kubectl_describe.structured.json", "summary_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/dc0c18d69a344258-g1/tools/004-evidence-kubectl_describe.summary.txt"}

