data: {"id": "dc0c18d69a344258-thinking-parallel_evidence-782", "run_id": "dc0c18d69a344258", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 已采集事实与因果\n\n**实体身份与生命周期**\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-v05/workload` (UID: `b9e687f5-702b-4d01-bfb9-2df4ff23ba91`)\n- **状态**: `Pending` (Prometheus `kube_pod_status_phase=1` for Pending) / 容器状态 `Waiting` (Reason: `ContainerCreating`)\n- **节点**: `node2` (10.2.0.50)，已通过 Topology 确认 `scheduled_on` 关系。\n- **容器**: 只有一个 `app` 容器，重启次数为 0。\n- **日志/Trace**: 均为 `empty/absent`。由于 Pod 处于 `Pending` 且容器未启动（无 IP、无 Container ID），这是完全预期的结果。\n\n**支持候选原因的根因证据（Volume Mount 失败）**\n- 候选原因已从上游的 `ContainerCreating` 直接原因待验证，收敛为 **", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789124762257, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

