data: {"id": "dc0c18d69a344258-final", "run_id": "dc0c18d69a344258", "seq": 787, "ts_ms": 1789124777056, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v05/workload` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload 在 aiops-case-v05 中处于 ContainerCreating 状态，未能进入 Running |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubelet | `FailedMount: MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap references non-existent config key: unavailable-key` (fact-19e347d2b645) | 直接指出 Volume 挂载因 ConfigMap 键不存在而失败 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubelet | Pod `status: Pending` (fact-bb379fb9ff40) | 证实 Pod 处于不可用状态 |\n| 3 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason = 1` (reason: ContainerCreating, fact-a51f57a898c5) | 证实容器处于等待挂载阶段 |\n| 4 | Config | K8s Spec | Container `app` memory request: `8Mi`, limit: `32Mi` (fact-668f3a9229a4, fact-0ce4993ab691) | 资源规格配置正常，排除资源争抢导致的 OOM 或调度失败 |\n\n- **事实印证**：事件中的 `FailedMount` 错误与 Metric 显示的 `ContainerCreating` 等待状态完全吻合。\n- **证据关联**：由于挂载失败，容器未能启动，因此无 Logging/Tracing 数据。根因由 K8s Event 明确提供。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap 'workload-input' 中缺失 key 'unavailable-key' → kubelet 挂载卷 'input' 时校验失败 → MountVolume.SetUp 报错导致 Volume 挂载超时/失败 → Pod 停留在 Pending/ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n- **已确认的根因**：Pod `aiops-case-v05/workload` 中的 Volume `input` 挂载失败，其根本原因是 ConfigMap 中引用的配置键 `unavailable-key` 不存在（证据 #1）。\n- **现象解释**：由于核心存储卷无法挂载，Pod 无法进入 Running 状态，导致用户观测到的 Pod 持续处于 `ContainerCreating` 或 `Pending` 状态（证据 #2, #3）。\n- **结论**：故障由配置错误引起，非资源不足或网络问题。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 9.3m\n├─ 问题定位: 14.7s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 538.3s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v05/workload: 538.3s (Evidence 531.4s, RCA 6.8s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 7.9s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v05/workload**: pod-imagepull-failed, pod-pending-unschedulable, pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 560.92, "metrics": {"run_id": "dc0c18d69a344258", "mttr": {"value": "9.3m", "seconds": 560.9384636878967, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "45%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed, pod-pending-unschedulable, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 560938.4636878967, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 552971.7078208923, "tool_calls": 13, "executed_tool_calls": 10, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 2, "successful_tool_calls": 12, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 20960.213899612427, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 7608.995676040649}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 14731.665849685669, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 538293.35